{"v":1,"book":"Ezek","ch":24,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Then the word of Jehovah came to me, in the ninth year, in the tenth month, on the tenth day of the month, saying,","tok":[{"t":"Then the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" came to me, in the "},{"t":"ninth","s":["H8671"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"year","s":["H8141"],"a":[4]},{"t":", in the "},{"t":"tenth","s":["H6218"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"month","s":["H2320"],"a":[9]},{"t":", on the "},{"t":"tenth","s":["H6224"],"a":[7]},{"t":" day of the "},{"t":"month","s":["H2320"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[10]},{"t":","}]},{"n":2,"text":"Son of man, write down the name of the day, this very day. The king of Babylon has laid siege to Jerusalem this very day.","tok":[{"t":"Son","s":["H1121"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"write","s":["H3789"],"a":[2]},{"t":" down the "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[6]},{"t":", this "},{"t":"very","s":["H6106"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[9]},{"t":". The "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[13]},{"t":" has laid siege to "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[15]},{"t":" this "},{"t":"very","s":["H6106"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And utter a parable to the rebellious house, and say to them, Thus says the Lord Jehovah, Put on a pot — put it on; And also pour water into it;","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"utter","s":["H4911"],"a":[0]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"parable","s":["H4912"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"rebellious","s":["H4805"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to them, Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[9]},{"t":" Jehovah, Put "},{"t":"on","s":["H8239"],"a":[11]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"pot","s":["H5518"],"a":[12]},{"t":" — put it "},{"t":"on","s":["H8239"],"a":[13]},{"t":"; And also "},{"t":"pour","s":["H3332"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[17]},{"t":" into it;"}]},{"n":4,"text":"Gather into it its pieces, Every good piece, the thigh, and the shoulder; Fill it with choice bones.","tok":[{"t":"Gather","s":["H0622"],"a":[0]},{"t":" into it its "},{"t":"pieces","s":["H5409"],"a":[1]},{"t":", Every "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"piece","s":["H5409"],"a":[4]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"thigh","s":["H3409"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"shoulder","s":["H3802"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Fill","s":["H4390"],"a":[10]},{"t":" it with "},{"t":"choice","s":["H4005"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"bones","s":["H6106"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Take the choice of the flock, And also put a pile of wood under it; Bring it to a vigorous boil; Indeed let its bones be boiled in it.","tok":[{"t":"Take","s":["H3947"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"choice","s":["H4005"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"flock","s":["H6629"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And also put a pile of wood under it; Bring it to a vigorous "},{"t":"boil","s":["H7570"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; Indeed let its "},{"t":"bones","s":["H6106"],"a":[11]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"boiled","s":["H8432"],"a":[12]},{"t":" in it."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Therefore thus says the Lord Jehovah, Woe to the bloody city, to the pot in which there is rust and whose rust has not gone out of it! Take its pieces out of it piece by piece; no lot has fallen upon it.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3069"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Woe","s":["H0188"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"bloody","s":["H1818"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[6]},{"t":", to the "},{"t":"pot","s":["H5518"],"a":[8]},{"t":" in which there is rust and whose rust has not gone "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of it! Take its pieces "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[18]},{"t":" of it "},{"t":"piece","s":["H5409"],"a":[16]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"piece","s":["H5409"],"a":[17]},{"t":"; no "},{"t":"lot","s":["H1486"],"a":[22]},{"t":" has fallen upon it."}]},{"n":7,"text":"For her blood was within her; she put it on a bare rock; she did not pour it upon the ground to cover it with dust.","tok":[{"t":"For her "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[1]},{"t":" was within her; she put it on a bare "},{"t":"rock","s":["H5553"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; she did not "},{"t":"pour","s":["H8210"],"a":[9]},{"t":" it upon the "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0776"],"a":[11]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"cover","s":["H3680"],"a":[12]},{"t":" it with "},{"t":"dust","s":["H6083"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"In order to stir up wrath, to take vengeance, I have set her blood upon a bare rock, so that it might not be covered.","tok":[{"t":"In order to stir "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[0]},{"t":" wrath, to "},{"t":"take","s":["H5358"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"vengeance","s":["H5359"],"a":[3]},{"t":", I have "},{"t":"set","s":["H5414"],"a":[4]},{"t":" her "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[6]},{"t":" upon a "},{"t":"bare","s":["H6706"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rock","s":["H5553"],"a":[9]},{"t":", so that it might not be "},{"t":"covered","s":["H3680"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Therefore thus says the Lord Jehovah, Woe to the bloody city! I will also make the pile great.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3069"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Woe","s":["H0188"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"bloody","s":["H1818"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[6]},{"t":"! I will also make the "},{"t":"pile","s":["H4071"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"great","s":["H1431"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Heap on the wood, light the fire, boil the meat well, and mix in spi